# Every text file is LF in the repo and on checkout, on every OS (a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true
# would otherwise give the sh launcher CRLF and break it). Nothing is converted: blobs are already LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
# The Windows launcher is stored with CRLF as-is and never converted.
*.cmd -text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
